    },
    {
      "id": "song-905",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "临江仙",
      "subtitle": "淡水三年欢意危",
      "author": "晏几道",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "淡水三年欢意，危弦几夜离情。\n晓霜红叶舞归程。\n客情今古道，秋梦短长亭。\n渌酒尊前清泪，阳关叠里离声。\n少陵诗思旧才名。\n云鸿相约处，烟雾九重城。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "011fc63d5d80575750a48d732fac8ea2492145ac839d812bf7842f851efd0b9c",
      "estimatedOutput": 746,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-905--011fc63d5d80575750a48d732fac8ea2492145ac839d812bf7842f851efd0b9c.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-906",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "临江仙",
      "subtitle": "浅浅馀寒春半雪",
      "author": "晏几道",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "浅浅馀寒春半，雪消蕙草初长。\n烟迷柳岸旧池塘。\n风吹梅蕊闹，雨细杏花香。\n月堕枝头欢意，从前虚梦高唐，觉来何处放思量。\n如今不是梦，真个到伊行。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "c7ee90c6b5c339422973dd2cf6c9bd18d5285a98e3c1f91f4c61b756e0ffe0fd",
      "estimatedOutput": 744,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-906--c7ee90c6b5c339422973dd2cf6c9bd18d5285a98e3c1f91f4c61b756e0ffe0fd.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-907",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "临江仙",
      "subtitle": "长爱碧阑干影芙",
      "author": "晏几道",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "长爱碧阑干影，芙蓉秋水开时。\n脸红凝露学娇啼。\n霞觞熏冷艳，云髻袅纤枝。\n烟雨依前时候，霜丛如旧芳菲。\n与谁同醉采香归。\n去年花下客，今似蝶分飞。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "b953fecd1441cd75b4ff892023482ec913527ef838b6fb4585ff5ebb9bde7cf3",
      "estimatedOutput": 746,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-907--b953fecd1441cd75b4ff892023482ec913527ef838b6fb4585ff5ebb9bde7cf3.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-908",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "临江仙",
      "subtitle": "旖旎仙花解语轻",
      "author": "晏几道",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "旖旎仙花解语，轻盈春柳能眠。\n玉楼深处绮窗前。\n梦回芳草夜，歌罢落梅天。\n沈水浓熏绣被，流霞浅酌金船。\n绿娇红小正堪怜。\n莫如云易散，须似月频圆。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "474aebd5d4a46fab437aac599b473dda32f8e77657390c72a625e4986ea7a080",
      "estimatedOutput": 746,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-908--474aebd5d4a46fab437aac599b473dda32f8e77657390c72a625e4986ea7a080.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-909",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "临江仙",
      "subtitle": "东野亡来无丽句",
      "author": "晏几道",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "东野亡来无丽句，于君去后少交亲。\n追思往事好沾巾。\n白头王建在，犹见咏诗人。\n学道深山空自老，留名千载不干身。\n酒筵歌席莫辞频。\n争如南陌上，占取一年春。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "e983d47a42c1e62c11e44ccc34a1b74666cb1dff884b940435a3c0bb7a936687",
